{"data": {"node": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "35155975027349723", "organization": {"id": "858537759676863", "viewer_permissions": [], "application_groupings": {"nodes": [{"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "35155975027349723"}]}, "id": "839943322470006"}, {"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "26077414655255846"}]}, "id": "1248256544163687"}]}}, "firstRevision": {"nodes": [{"application": {"id": "35155975027349723", "release_date": 1795542000, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "scheduled_offers": {"count": 2}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "40237477749199400"}, "id": "977882804594937"}]}}, "binary": null, "live_binary": null, "created_date": 1795555704, "id": "40524200793860426", "is_initial_release": false, "name_with_fallback": "v2", "pdp_metadata_with_fallback": {"version": 2, "application": {"is_concept": false, "latest_released_pdp_metadata": {"id": "40524461783834327"}, "release_status": "RELEASED", "id": "35155975027349723"}, "id": "40524461783834327", "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED"}, "release_date": null, "administration_status": "APPROVED", "is_first": false, "release_status": "RELEASED", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "35155975027349723", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "1038761049013176"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "3015563092120299", "locale": "fr_FR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Trash Inspector", "keywords": ["recyclage", "recycler", "d\u00e9chets", "poubelle", "ordures"], "long_description": "Bienvenue dans ton nouveau job au centre de recyclage. \u00c7a a l'air simple. \u00c7a ne l'est pas.\n\nTrash Inspector te place face \u00e0 un tapis roulant qui ne s'arr\u00eate jamais. Bouteilles, canettes, cartons, bocaux, vieux appareils et objets myst\u00e8res arrivent vers toi : attrape-les et jette-les dans la bonne poubelle avant que le tapis ne d\u00e9borde.\n\nTRIE AVEC TES MAINS\n\nChaque mati\u00e8re a sa place : organique, verre, plastique, papier, m\u00e9tal, \u00e9lectronique et piles. Prends-le, v\u00e9rifie sa mati\u00e8re et lance-le. Un tir parfait depuis l'autre bout du hangar, quel plaisir.\n\nENCHA\u00ceNE LES COMBOS, TIENS BON\n\nChaque vague est plus rapide et plus folle que la pr\u00e9c\u00e9dente. Garde ta s\u00e9rie pour multiplier tes points, mais une poubelle rat\u00e9e et tout s'accumule.\n\nAM\u00c9LIORE TON CENTRE\n\nD\u00e9pense tes gains \u00e0 la boutique : drones assistants, aimant pour la ferraille et modules qui ralentissent le tapis, multiplient tes points ou d\u00e9clenchent l'arr\u00eat d'urgence.\n\nDU CENTRE DE TRI \u00c0 LA PLAGE\n\nPasse d'un petit centre de tri \u00e0 de plus grands centres de recyclage, puis \u00e0 une plage \u00e0 nettoyer, avec Tritou, le sac poubelle qui t'apprend le m\u00e9tier.\n\nCARACT\u00c9RISTIQUES\n\n- Le recyclage \u00e0 la main, pens\u00e9 pour la VR\n- 7 types de d\u00e9chets, chacun avec sa poubelle\n- Multiplicateurs de combo et difficult\u00e9 par vagues\n- Boutique avec drones, aimant et am\u00e9liorations du tapis\n- Assis ou debout, avec rotation par paliers, vignette et mode facile\n- Des sessions courtes, parfaites pour une pause\n\nEnfile tes gants. Le tapis tourne d\u00e9j\u00e0.", "short_description": "Attrape, trie et lance dans un centre de recyclage en plein chaos ! Les d\u00e9chets d\u00e9filent sur le tapis roulant en vagues de plus en plus rapides : bouteilles en plastique, papier, verre, canettes, appareils \u00e9lectroniques et piles. Jette chaque d\u00e9chet dans la bonne poubelle avant que tout s'entasse, encha\u00eene les combos et d\u00e9pense tes gains en drones, aimants et am\u00e9liorations du tapis. Un jeu de tri en VR rapide et physique, qui se joue avec tes propres mains."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1836739120990744", "locale": "ja_JP", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Trash Inspector", "keywords": ["\u30ea\u30b5\u30a4\u30af\u30eb", "\u30b4\u30df", "\u3054\u307f", "\u5206\u5225", "\u6e05\u6383"], "long_description": "\u30ea\u30b5\u30a4\u30af\u30eb\u5de5\u5834\u3067\u306e\u65b0\u3057\u3044\u4ed5\u4e8b\u3078\u3088\u3046\u3053\u305d\u3002\u7c21\u5358\u305d\u3046\u306b\u898b\u3048\u308b\uff1f\u305d\u3093\u306a\u3053\u3068\u306f\u306a\u3044\u3002\n\nTrash Inspector\u3067\u306f\u3001\u6c7a\u3057\u3066\u6b62\u307e\u3089\u306a\u3044\u30d9\u30eb\u30c8\u30b3\u30f3\u30d9\u30a2\u306e\u524d\u306b\u7acb\u3064\u3053\u3068\u306b\u306a\u308b\u3002\u30da\u30c3\u30c8\u30dc\u30c8\u30eb\u3001\u7a7a\u304d\u7f36\u3001\u6bb5\u30dc\u30fc\u30eb\u3001\u30ac\u30e9\u30b9\u74f6\u3001\u53e4\u3044\u5bb6\u96fb\u3001\u305d\u3057\u3066\u8b0e\u306e\u7269\u4f53\u307e\u3067\u3001\u6b21\u3005\u3068\u6d41\u308c\u3066\u304f\u308b\u3002\u3072\u3068\u3064\u305a\u3064\u3064\u304b\u3093\u3067\u3001\u30b3\u30f3\u30d9\u30a2\u304c\u57cb\u3082\u308c\u308b\u524d\u306b\u6b63\u3057\u3044\u30b4\u30df\u7bb1\u3078\u6295\u3052\u8fbc\u3082\u3046\u3002\n\n\u81ea\u5206\u306e\u624b\u3067\u5206\u5225\n\n\u751f\u30b4\u30df\u3001\u30ac\u30e9\u30b9\u3001\u30d7\u30e9\u30b9\u30c1\u30c3\u30af\u3001\u7d19\u3001\u91d1\u5c5e\u3001\u96fb\u5b50\u6a5f\u5668\u3001\u96fb\u6c60\u3002\u7d20\u6750\u3054\u3068\u306b\u884c\u304d\u5148\u306f\u6c7a\u307e\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3002\u624b\u306b\u53d6\u3063\u3066\u3001\u4f55\u3067\u3067\u304d\u3066\u3044\u308b\u304b\u3092\u78ba\u304b\u3081\u3066\u3001\u6295\u3052\u308b\u3002\u5de5\u5834\u306e\u53cd\u5bfe\u5074\u304b\u3089\u306e\u5b8c\u74a7\u306a\u30b7\u30e5\u30fc\u30c8\u306f\u6700\u9ad8\u306b\u6c17\u6301\u3061\u3044\u3044\u3002\n\n\u30b3\u30f3\u30dc